#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:3
#: 6bc60218ba9c4407ae4b5f0e3ff32f7b
msgid "随机掺杂（Random Doping）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:5
#: d9033db3eea0484fb7325d1376a173f7
msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `RandomDopingCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:7
#: 9d46afb7042547d6bb8f809f9dff2976
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:9
#: 9932daa8645b4e929e8672223f6b1f55
msgid "按规则表对指定元素位点做替位掺杂。可以精确控制\"替换谁、换成什么、换多少\"，支持按原子百分比、质量百分比或固定数量采样。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:11
#: 8f64665e26a447f6b530b7bf138226e1
msgid "**和 `Random Occupancy` / `Composition Sweep` 的区别：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:12
#: d7a8cab0eaf54b32a8e2039f7c103075
msgid "`Composition Sweep`：定义\"目标配比空间\"，不改原子占位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:13
#: 8645356f59154fd38dcf6bb4469b8630
msgid "`Random Occupancy`：把目标配比落到离散占位上，需要输入有 `Comp(...)` 标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:14
#: 469eb49961674f0dbb7c57914e1a96d8
msgid "`Random Doping`：直接给定规则（target + dopants + 比例），做一次随机替换。更直接、更手工，但不扫配比空间"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:16
#: 89a62ced0fc140768d7662a5f0cbc70c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:18
#: c8a516ab8b594d459d235a22a209359c
msgid "场景：纯元素模型在掺杂体系上完全失效"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:20
#: 833cccc438b140b3afc7d5c36a8cc550
msgid ""
"你在纯 Si 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，能量和力都收敛得很好。然后尝试跑 Si:Ge 合金——模型直接崩溃：碰到 Ge "
"原子的局域环境完全没见过，力预测误差跳了一个数量级。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:22
#: d6c07e95ac5540ffbc02407ef2bcc090
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 训练集里只有 Si-Si 键环境，模型不知道 Ge 原子的存在，更不知道 Si-Ge 键和 Ge-Ge "
"键应该长什么样。需要往训练集中加入真实的 Si 位点被 Ge 替换的结构，让模型学习掺杂原子周围的局域化学环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:24
#: ab2926d4e5244cfdbe56cd8f80e7cb23
msgid "**输入：** 一个纯 Si 超胞结构，已经弛豫"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:26
#: b83e21dce3be495c9593e48867c4e02d
msgid "**目标：** 每帧替换 3~8% 的 Si 为 Ge，每帧生成 20 个版本，覆盖不同掺杂落点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:28
#: 2bdf1609212242429d5726ae736f6fa3
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:29
#: 6597f27c12f84a60b4339c1d0fcafd10
msgid "`Rules`：target=`Si`, dopants=`Ge`, use=`atomic_percent`, percent=`[3, 8]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:30
#: 7fd5b5a9122b44fdb77760a7a1ea08f3
msgid "`Doping Type`：`Exact` （对比实验需要稳定的掺杂数量）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:31
#: 298b1677ffb24fe99be5f821312e90bb
msgid "`Structures`：`[20]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:33
#: b72b931dd1a24152b9fdef3d5f2a7640
msgid "**输出：** 20 个掺杂结构，每帧中 3~8% 的 Si 变成 Ge，带 `Dop(n=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:35
#: 6a689a8e12394efca5a797c787552ae1
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:36
#: 763941582ba7477f9f5676b1e5e61285
msgid "重训后跑 Si:Ge 测试集，力的 MAE 应该回到和纯 Si 训练集接近的水平"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:37
#: 443a8b9cfb9349428e04fa36158d1ff1
msgid "抽查几个掺杂输出，Ge 原子的最近邻距离是否合理（Si-Ge 键长应略大于 Si-Si）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:38
#: e803a19229a841ea9cbe1be753716c89
msgid "如果模型对高浓度掺杂仍然不准，扩大 `percent` 上限到 15~20%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:39
#: 4cad9587df4a4189b3083719dd8300ff
msgid "如果只掺一种元素，dopants 可以直接写 `Ge`，等价于 `Ge:1.0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:40
#: c6a66fc36141495c8b24ce27b8d518eb
msgid "如果需要多元素掺杂（如同时掺 Ge 和 C），在 dopants 里写 `Ge:0.7,C:0.3`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:42
#: 2df05496093c4d8bad75488770b5d4cb
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:44
#: 3c1d3334d72c4523b589293068246f7c
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:45
#: 7f23f3c0efc84097b36954b2fdb2a2fa
msgid "模型在掺杂/合金体系上预测质量明显差于纯元素体系"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:46
#: 3a1b1de538e041dfa8f0306bd28642b2
msgid "需要覆盖特定掺杂元素周围的局域化学环境"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:47
#: c171a3a9327c4f7e9d3825a72c2f20ac
msgid "有明确的掺杂规则（target + dopants + 比例），但不需系统扫描完整配比空间"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:49
#: a8b783058af34be7823d19e5a4438128
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:50
#: d0b6edcef4fa434cb8798f94fd4155af
msgid "需要系统扫配比空间 → 先用 `Composition Sweep`，再接 `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:51
#: aed1a0bf3362402886bc27dc1595261e
msgid "只需要全局随机占位 → 用 `Random Occupancy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:53
#: 5b79bd0c7f034003b3ca37d357a14e35
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:55
#: 050ad163f4934ae1a576d7a4d6dcc0db
msgid "Rules（rules）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:57
#: ab901073aa1442cfbbcf1ee30335101f
msgid ""
"`list[dict[str, Any]]`，默认空列表。每条 rule 定义目标元素、替换元素、比例/计数和可选 "
"group。复杂掺杂优先拆成多条明确 rule，不要把不同物理缺陷混成一个概率池。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:59
#: 3577a922b40f43adb1aa7b5b6575f973
msgid ""
"rule 内的典型字段：`target`（被替换元素）、`dopants`（替换元素及权重 "
"dict）、`use`（`atomic_percent` / `mass_percent` / `count`）、`percent`（百分比范围 "
"`[min, max]` 或 `[fixed]`）、`count`（固定替换个数）、`group`（可选，限制只在此 group 内操作）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:61
#: 7992701676af49e580bb30544123d4a7
msgid "Doping Type（doping_type）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:63
#: c40cada3f62e47a38d90cd1aff5cabcd
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Random`。`Random` 按权重概率随机采样，每帧替换数量有浮动。`Exact` "
"尽量匹配精确计数，替换数量更稳定，适合对比实验。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:65
#: def99d728fe84f4ea1ea8543ee3fb93e
msgid "Max Structures（max_structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:67
#: 429b2df979924e9886848ebb9d90bf4a
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构最多输出的掺杂构型数。低浓度精确掺杂可用 10-50，高维随机合金应后接 FPS 控制预算。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:69
#: ca081d1f3e4447cf809096b218609116
msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:71
#: dbe4f06f41854261ab8530995b6bb049
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后固定种子可复现。对比实验时开，探索阶段可以关着。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:73
#: 3b461a21c924490dab68190f729c9064
msgid "Seed（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:75
#: ffc384a3fcbe452382cd44d60e9ef8c1
msgid "`int`，默认 0。不同取值产生不同的替换分布。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:77
#: 9ae1d262e8f5424fa678452c04177061
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:79
#: 336a88e9761b432198671f7773632968
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:81
#: 83093f87c236493da5510b2f1710980c
msgid "低浓度单元素掺杂（Si:Ge, 1~2%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:82
#: 5d1be054293848e3ac6eec241ae2a549
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Si\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Ge\": 1.0},\n"
"        \"use\": \"atomic_percent\",\n"
"        \"percent\": [1, 2]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 101\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:103
#: 7051df93b8d14022b766155f023f9b38
msgid "中浓度双元素掺杂（Si:Ge/C, 3~8%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:104
#: 5ddaed797cbb4c4f92d718d07aa07e27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Si\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Ge\": 0.7, \"C\": 0.3},\n"
"        \"use\": \"atomic_percent\",\n"
"        \"percent\": [3, 8]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Exact\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 101\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:125
#: 102154b0624848fbb4bdca60296e516d
msgid "高浓度多元素探索（Si:Ge/C/Sn, 8~20%）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:126
#: 3cfcf08068a0452e99e42684354ee5de
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"RandomDopingCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"rules\": [\n"
"      {\n"
"        \"target\": \"Si\",\n"
"        \"dopants\": {\"Ge\": 0.5, \"C\": 0.3, \"Sn\": 0.2},\n"
"        \"use\": \"atomic_percent\",\n"
"        \"percent\": [8, 20]\n"
"      }\n"
"    ],\n"
"    \"doping_type\": \"Random\",\n"
"    \"max_structures\": 20,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 101\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:147
#: 499bc1bef03747119cce32105eb30121
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:149
#: 93e7834d268b4a1e951bf037904ec65d
msgid "`Group Label` → `Random Doping`：只掺杂特定子晶格/层，不污染其他区域"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:150
#: 13e0329c12e14de3a5fb2a770dd519f6
msgid ""
"`Composition Sweep` → `Random Occupancy` → `Random Doping`：先扫配比 → 落位 → "
"再补局部随机替换"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:151
#: ef57152b03f94dad8c0c940bbd8e8dd6
msgid "`Random Doping` → `Atomic Perturb`：掺杂后加坐标噪声，松驰局部应力"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:153
#: f463e5a9d9374d8b8ffca5da9be93f82
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:155
#: 59f1e85da09c4ea589d2185811f1c495
msgid "**输出和输入一样，没有替换。** 检查 rules 是否为空、target 元素是否真的存在于输入结构中、group 过滤是否把候选位点全滤掉了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:157
#: e425808c366041caaa28d9046dd6d832
msgid ""
"**掺杂比例偏离预期。** 如果用 `Random` 模式，小样本下统计浮动大。换成 `Exact` 可以减少波动。如果用的是 "
"`mass_percent`，确认目标元素和掺杂元素的质量差异是否导致了原子比例偏移。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:159
#: 9ee0fa21f4a94473a55069bd385a0fff
msgid "**掺杂后键长异常。** 这是纯化学替换，不做结构弛豫。替换后键长取决于新元素的原子半径和原晶格参数的匹配度。如果键长明显不合理，建议后接弛豫计算。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:161
#: e6b966efebb347648e3fcdf0f29e29e3
msgid ""
"**多条规则之间的交互。** 规则按顺序执行。如果两条规则操作同一个 target "
"元素，第二条会在第一条的结果上继续替换。注意不要设计互相冲突的规则。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:163
#: 0c9fab34a292477ea7f154980b13599a
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:165
#: 85e7a4bce827447b86c77cf90212fd84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Dop(n={替换原子数})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:167
#: 223e31ebf139406bb324ca0267018b5a
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-doping-card.md:169
#: 0ea24d0d20214b959018a864f76c3d6d
msgid ""
"勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` 可复现。注意输入结构顺序变化也会影响结果——建议把 seed 与 pipeline "
"配置一起版本化。"
msgstr ""
